PROBLEM STATEMENT 
The gaming industry is experiencing rapid growth, with esports tournaments, gaming conventions, and community events attracting thousands of participants 
and spectators. However, many event organizers still rely on multiple disconnected systems or manual processes for ticket booking, participant registration, payment 
collection, and attendee management. These methods often lead to long registration times, duplicate entries, ticket fraud, payment errors, poor communication, and 
difficulty in tracking event attendance. Participants also face challenges in discovering events, securing tickets, receiving timely updates, and accessing digital passes. 
Therefore, there is a need for a centralized, secure, and user-friendly Gaming Events Ticketing & Registration Platform that streamlines the entire event management 
process. The platform should enable online event discovery, digital ticket booking, secure payment processing, participant registration, QR code-based 
check-in, real-time notifications, and analytics for organizers, ensuring a seamless experience for both event organizers and attendees.
